BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:reynard-0.19.0@omnisource
DTSTAMP:20261026T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261026
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261027
SUMMARY:Reynard v0.19.0
DESCRIPTION:Reynard 0.19.0 | Reynard\n\n## Changes\n\n**Full Changelog**: h
 ttps://github.com/minh-ton/reynard-browser/compare/0.18.0...0.19.0\n\n### 
 New Features\n- Added support for game controllers.\n- You can now import 
 and export your bookmarks\, history\, and add-ons:\n  - Bookmarks can be i
 mported from and exported to other browsers as an HTML file.\n  - History 
 can be imported from Safari or Google Takeout (Chrome)\, and exported in S
 afari's format.\n  - Add-ons can be imported from and exported to another 
 Reynard install.\n\n### Bug Fixes & Improvements\n- Webpages that fail to 
 load now show an error page explaining what went wrong\, with options to t
 ry again or go back.\n- You can now right-click a Favorite site on the hom
 epage using a pointer device to reveal its context menu.\n- Fixed an issue
  where pull to refresh would occasionally get stuck\, with the refresh spi
 nner appearing indefinitely.\n- Fixed numerous UI issues.\n\n### Engine\n\
 nUpdated Gecko to [158.0.1](https://github.com/mozilla-firefox/firefox/com
 mit/FIREFOX_158_0_1_RELEASE) (released Oct 20\, 2026).
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/reynard.json
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:reynard-0.18.0@omnisource
DTSTAMP:20261018T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261018
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261019
SUMMARY:Reynard v0.18.0
DESCRIPTION:Reynard 0.18.0 | Reynard\n\n## Changes\n\n**Full Changelog**: h
 ttps://github.com/minh-ton/reynard-browser/compare/0.17.1...0.18.0\n\n### 
 New Features\n- When a webpage uses a keyboard shortcut that conflicts wit
 h one of the app's\, the first press now goes to the webpage\, and a hint 
 appears in the address bar letting you press the shortcut again to trigger
  the app's.\n\n### Improvements\n- Scrolling on webpages is now smoother a
 nd more accurate.\n- Improved audio handling\, with better echo cancellati
 on\, voice processing\, recovery after interruptions\, and handling of aud
 io device changes.\n\n### Bug Fixes\n- Fixed an issue where keyboard short
 cuts would not be recognized by websites after using Find in Page or a `<s
 elect>` element.\n- Fixed an issue where the image preview and its actions
  would not work on certain images\, such as those requiring authentication
  or in the WebP format.\n- Fixed an issue where tapping the status bar to 
 scroll to the top would not scroll completely to the top of the webpage wh
 en using the top address bar.\n- Fixed an issue where touches on some webp
 ages would land in the wrong place.\n- Added small performance improvement
 s and fixed several UI issues.\n\n### Engine\n\nUpdated Gecko to [158.0](h
 ttps://github.com/mozilla-firefox/firefox/commit/FIREFOX_158_0_RELEASE) (r
 eleased Oct 13\, 2026).
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/reynard.json
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:reynard-0.17.1@omnisource
DTSTAMP:20261012T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261012
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261013
SUMMARY:Reynard v0.17.1
DESCRIPTION:Reynard 0.17.1 | Reynard\n\n## Changes\n\n**Full Changelog**: h
 ttps://github.com/minh-ton/reynard-browser/compare/0.17.0...0.17.1\n\nThis
  is a minor release that fixes issues found in 0.17.0. For the complete li
 st of changes\, see the [0.17.0 release notes](https://github.com/minh-ton
 /reynard-browser/releases/tag/0.17.0).\n\n### Bug Fixes & Improvements\n- 
 Text selections outside input fields now offer more actions\, such as Look
  Up\, Find Selection\, Translate\, and Share.\n- Fixed a crash when editin
 g in scrollable text fields on iOS 14 and older.\n- Fixed an issue where t
 ouching the selection handles to drag them would clear the selection in te
 xt fields on some webpages.\n- Fixed an issue where the caret and text sel
 ection would not stay aligned with sticky text while scrolling.\n- Fixed a
 n issue where tapping a focused text field or caret would not bring up the
  edit menu on iOS 17 and later.\n- Fixed an issue where images copied from
  another app would not paste into webpages.
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/reynard.json
END:VEVENT
